<title>UK: UK inflation unchanged at 2.1 pct in September.</title>
<headline>UK inflation unchanged at 2.1 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail prices rose 0.5 percent in September for an annual increase of 2.1 percent, official figures showed on Thursday. Both the figures were unchanged from August but they were at the top end of analysts' expectations. The Treasury said cost pressures in the British economy remained subdued.</p>
</text>
